# ${APP_NAME}

## Local Development with Skaffold

### Prerequisites
- Kind cluster running (\`make setup\`)
- Skaffold installed (\`scripts/install-tools.sh\`)
- /etc/hosts entry: \`127.0.0.1 ${APP_NAME}.local\`

### Quick Start

\`\`\`bash
# Development mode with hot reload (file sync)
skaffold dev --profile=debug

# Standard development mode
skaffold dev

# Build and deploy once
skaffold run

# Clean up
skaffold delete
\`\`\`

### Access the App

- **API**: http://${APP_NAME}.local
- **Health**: http://${APP_NAME}.local/health
- **Port-forward** (automatic): http://localhost:${LOCAL_PORT}

### Helm Development

\`\`\`bash
# Install manually with Helm
helm install ${APP_NAME} helm/ -f helm/values-local.yaml

# Upgrade
helm upgrade ${APP_NAME} helm/ -f helm/values-local.yaml

# Uninstall
helm uninstall ${APP_NAME}
\`\`\`

### Building the Image

\`\`\`bash
# Build and load into Kind
docker build -t ${APP_NAME}:dev .
kind load docker-image ${APP_NAME}:dev --name playground
\`\`\`

### Cloud Deployment

\`\`\`bash
# Build for production
skaffold build --profile=prod

# Deploy to cloud cluster (switch context first)
skaffold deploy --profile=prod
\`\`\`

## Configuration

- **Local values**: \`helm/values-local.yaml\`
- **Production values**: \`helm/values.yaml\`
- **Skaffold**: \`skaffold.yaml\`

## Environment Variables

See \`helm/values-local.yaml\` for local environment configuration.
